       The trusted destination for professionals, college students, and lifelong learners.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-blue" href="https://premium.britannica.com/premium-membership/?utm_source=premium&amp;utm_medium=inline-cta&amp;utm_campaign=redesign-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SUBSCRIBE</a>
    </div>
   <!-- Left side decorative elements -->
    <div class="hermes-cta-decorative-left">
      <img src="https://cdn.britannica.com/marketing/inline-left.webp" alt="Penguin, ship, mountain, atlas" class="hermes-cta-decorative-image" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <!-- Right side decorative elements -->
    <div class="hermes-cta-decorative-right">
      <img src="https://cdn.britannica.com/marketing/inline-right.webp" alt="shohei ohtani, plants, andy wharhol art" class="hermes-cta-decorative-image" loading="lazy">
    </div>
